<body style="margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;">
<div style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;max-width:1100px;margin:0;color:#1F497D;font-size:12pt;text-align:left;padding:20px;">
  <p style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:700;">Good morning!</p>
<p style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;margin-bottom:12px;">Below is the partial forecast of hours accounted for so far.</p>
<p style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;margin-bottom:12px;">Please note that the official closing will be done at the beginning of next month, when the monthly Book and the official consumption table for the period will be made available.</p>
<p style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;margin-bottom:12px;">We inform that this statement includes:</p>
<ul style="font-size:12pt;margin-bottom:16px;padding-left:24px;color:#1F497D;list-style-type:disc;">
<li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;">Automatic entries;</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;">Period requirements already accounted for in the consumption table;</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;">Requirements in development, not yet accounted for in the consumption table;</li>
</ul><p style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;margin-bottom:12px;">Therefore, the values and quantities presented may change until the official month-end closing.</p>
  
